                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80 [letter-spacing:.2px] [white-space:normal] [margin-bottom:0] [font-family:Switzer,_sans-serif] [font-size:14px] [font-weight:400] [line-height:150%] [opacity:.8] [pointer-events:auto] [text-wrap:balance] max-landscape:[font-size:13px] max-lg:[font-size:13px]">We plan for review from the start rather than treating it as a surprise at the end. Videos are built in modular scenes, so when your reviewers request a wording or visual change, we update that section without redoing the whole video, and review time is built into the timeline upfront.</p>
                  </div>
